# The in-game gate: a LIVE game session (live-pid /tmp/romm-in-game) blocks the daemon —
# it must never fight the player for the radio mid-play.
desc syncd: live in-game lock -> daemon stays dark
invoke syncd
timeout 6
charging on
ingame
config paired
wifi up
pending Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_timeout
expect_log romm-syncd started
expect_trace_absent ENGINE
